# BuildKit picks this up automatically for `-f apps/abacus/Dockerfile`
# (per-Dockerfile ignore file), so the repo-root build context holds only the
# two workspaces the image compiles: abacus and agent-runtime (for the
# `aitp-client` path dependency).
*
!apps/abacus/Cargo.toml
!apps/abacus/Cargo.lock
!apps/abacus/crates
!apps/agent-runtime/Cargo.toml
!apps/agent-runtime/Cargo.lock
!apps/agent-runtime/rust-toolchain.toml
!apps/agent-runtime/crates
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.env*
